{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"kubernetes-snippets","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Kubernetes Snippets","description":"Deployments, Services, Ingress, ConfigMaps, Secrets, CronJobs, volumes and probes for Kubernetes manifests.","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Snippets"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"snippets":[{"language":"YAML","path":"snippets/yaml.json"},{"language":"Config","path":"snippets/config.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"snippets/yaml.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Deployment\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"kdeploy\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"apiVersion: apps/v1\",\n      \"kind: Deployment\",\n      \"metadata:\",\n      \"  name: ${1:app}\",\n      \"  labels:\",\n      \"    app: ${1:app}\",\n      \"spec:\",\n      \"  replicas: ${2:2}\",\n      \"  selector:\",\n      \"    matchLabels:\",\n      \"      app: ${1:app}\",\n      \"  template:\",\n      \"    metadata:\",\n      \"      labels:\",\n      \"        app: ${1:app}\",\n      \"    spec:\",\n      \"      containers:\",\n      \"        - name: ${1:app}\",\n      \"          image: ${3:nginx:1.27}\",\n      \"          ports:\",\n      \"            - containerPort: ${4:80}\",\n      \"          resources:\",\n      \"            requests: { cpu: 100m, memory: 128Mi }\",\n      \"            limits: { cpu: 500m, memory: 256Mi }\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A Deployment\"\n  },\n  \"Service\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ksvc\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"apiVersion: v1\",\n      \"kind: Service\",\n      \"metadata:\",\n      \"  name: ${1:app}\",\n      \"spec:\",\n      \"  selector:\",\n      \"    app: ${1:app}\",\n      \"  ports:\",\n      \"    - port: ${2:80}\",\n      \"      targetPort: ${3:80}\",\n      \"  type: ${4:ClusterIP}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A Service\"\n  },\n  \"Ingress\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"king\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"apiVersion: networking.k8s.io/v1\",\n      \"kind: Ingress\",\n      \"metadata:\",\n      \"  name: ${1:app}\",\n      \"spec:\",\n      \"  rules:\",\n      \"    - host: ${2:example.com}\",\n      \"      http:\",\n      \"        paths:\",\n      \"          - path: /\",\n      \"            pathType: Prefix\",\n      \"            backend:\",\n      \"              service:\",\n      \"                name: ${1:app}\",\n      \"                port:\",\n      \"                  number: ${3:80}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An Ingress\"\n  },\n  \"ConfigMap\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"kcm\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"apiVersion: v1\",\n      \"kind: ConfigMap\",\n      \"metadata:\",\n      \"  name: ${1:config}\",\n      \"data:\",\n      \"  ${2:KEY}: \\\"${3:value}\\\"\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A ConfigMap\"\n  },\n  \"Secret\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ksecret\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"apiVersion: v1\",\n      \"kind: Secret\",\n      \"metadata:\",\n      \"  name: ${1:secret}\",\n      \"type: Opaque\",\n      \"stringData:\",\n      \"  ${2:KEY}: \\\"${3:value}\\\"\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A Secret\"\n  },\n  \"Persistent volume claim\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"kpvc\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"apiVersion: v1\",\n      \"kind: PersistentVolumeClaim\",\n      \"metadata:\",\n      \"  name: ${1:data}\",\n      \"spec:\",\n      \"  accessModes: [ReadWriteOnce]\",\n      \"  resources:\",\n      \"    requests:\",\n      \"      storage: ${2:1Gi}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A PVC\"\n  },\n  \"CronJob\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"kcron\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"apiVersion: batch/v1\",\n      \"kind: CronJob\",\n      \"metadata:\",\n      \"  name: ${1:job}\",\n      \"spec:\",\n      \"  schedule: \\\"${2:0 * * * *}\\\"\",\n      \"  jobTemplate:\",\n      \"    spec:\",\n      \"      template:\",\n      \"        spec:\",\n      \"          restartPolicy: OnFailure\",\n      \"          containers:\",\n      \"            - name: ${1:job}\",\n      \"              image: ${3:busybox}\",\n      \"              args: [\\\"${4:echo}\\\", \\\"${5:hello}\\\"]\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A CronJob\"\n  },\n  \"Probes\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"kprobe\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"livenessProbe:\",\n      \"  httpGet: { path: ${1:/healthz}, port: ${2:80} }\",\n      \"  initialDelaySeconds: 10\",\n      \"readinessProbe:\",\n      \"  httpGet: { path: ${1:/healthz}, port: ${2:80} }\",\n      \"  periodSeconds: 5\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Liveness and readiness probes\"\n  }\n}\n"},"snippets/config.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Deployment\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"kdeploy\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"apiVersion: apps/v1\",\n      \"kind: Deployment\",\n      \"metadata:\",\n      \"  name: ${1:app}\",\n      \"  labels:\",\n      \"    app: ${1:app}\",\n      \"spec:\",\n      \"  replicas: ${2:2}\",\n      \"  selector:\",\n      \"    matchLabels:\",\n      \"      app: ${1:app}\",\n      \"  template:\",\n      \"    metadata:\",\n      \"      labels:\",\n      \"        app: ${1:app}\",\n      \"    spec:\",\n      \"      containers:\",\n      \"        - name: ${1:app}\",\n      \"          image: ${3:nginx:1.27}\",\n      \"          ports:\",\n      \"            - containerPort: ${4:80}\",\n      \"          resources:\",\n      \"            requests: { cpu: 100m, memory: 128Mi }\",\n      \"            limits: { cpu: 500m, memory: 256Mi }\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A Deployment\"\n  },\n  \"Service\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ksvc\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"apiVersion: v1\",\n      \"kind: Service\",\n      \"metadata:\",\n      \"  name: ${1:app}\",\n      \"spec:\",\n      \"  selector:\",\n      \"    app: ${1:app}\",\n      \"  ports:\",\n      \"    - port: ${2:80}\",\n      \"      targetPort: ${3:80}\",\n      \"  type: ${4:ClusterIP}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A Service\"\n  },\n  \"Ingress\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"king\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"apiVersion: networking.k8s.io/v1\",\n      \"kind: Ingress\",\n      \"metadata:\",\n      \"  name: ${1:app}\",\n      \"spec:\",\n      \"  rules:\",\n      \"    - host: ${2:example.com}\",\n      \"      http:\",\n      \"        paths:\",\n      \"          - path: /\",\n      \"            pathType: Prefix\",\n      \"            backend:\",\n      \"              service:\",\n      \"                name: ${1:app}\",\n      \"                port:\",\n      \"                  number: ${3:80}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An Ingress\"\n  },\n  \"ConfigMap\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"kcm\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"apiVersion: v1\",\n      \"kind: ConfigMap\",\n      \"metadata:\",\n      \"  name: ${1:config}\",\n      \"data:\",\n      \"  ${2:KEY}: \\\"${3:value}\\\"\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A ConfigMap\"\n  },\n  \"Secret\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ksecret\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"apiVersion: v1\",\n      \"kind: Secret\",\n      \"metadata:\",\n      \"  name: ${1:secret}\",\n      \"type: Opaque\",\n      \"stringData:\",\n      \"  ${2:KEY}: \\\"${3:value}\\\"\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A Secret\"\n  },\n  \"Persistent volume claim\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"kpvc\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"apiVersion: v1\",\n      \"kind: PersistentVolumeClaim\",\n      \"metadata:\",\n      \"  name: ${1:data}\",\n      \"spec:\",\n      \"  accessModes: [ReadWriteOnce]\",\n      \"  resources:\",\n      \"    requests:\",\n      \"      storage: ${2:1Gi}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A PVC\"\n  },\n  \"CronJob\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"kcron\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"apiVersion: batch/v1\",\n      \"kind: CronJob\",\n      \"metadata:\",\n      \"  name: ${1:job}\",\n      \"spec:\",\n      \"  schedule: \\\"${2:0 * * * *}\\\"\",\n      \"  jobTemplate:\",\n      \"    spec:\",\n      \"      template:\",\n      \"        spec:\",\n      \"          restartPolicy: OnFailure\",\n      \"          containers:\",\n      \"            - name: ${1:job}\",\n      \"              image: ${3:busybox}\",\n      \"              args: [\\\"${4:echo}\\\", \\\"${5:hello}\\\"]\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A CronJob\"\n  },\n  \"Probes\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"kprobe\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"livenessProbe:\",\n      \"  httpGet: { path: ${1:/healthz}, port: ${2:80} }\",\n      \"  initialDelaySeconds: 10\",\n      \"readinessProbe:\",\n      \"  httpGet: { path: ${1:/healthz}, port: ${2:80} }\",\n      \"  periodSeconds: 5\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Liveness and readiness probes\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Kubernetes Snippets\n\nDeployments, Services, Ingress, ConfigMaps, Secrets, CronJobs, volumes and probes for Kubernetes manifests.\n\nType a prefix and press Tab. 16 snippets.\n\n| Language | Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| YAML | `kdeploy` | A Deployment |\n| YAML | `ksvc` | A Service |\n| YAML | `king` | An Ingress |\n| YAML | `kcm` | A ConfigMap |\n| YAML | `ksecret` | A Secret |\n| YAML | `kpvc` | A PVC |\n| YAML | `kcron` | A CronJob |\n| YAML | `kprobe` | Liveness and readiness probes |\n| Config | `kdeploy` | A Deployment |\n| Config | `ksvc` | A Service |\n| Config | `king` | An Ingress |\n| Config | `kcm` | A ConfigMap |\n| Config | `ksecret` | A Secret |\n| Config | `kpvc` | A PVC |\n| Config | `kcron` | A CronJob |\n| Config | `kprobe` | Liveness and readiness probes |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions.\n"}}}